 "blog": [
{ 
  "news_heading": "A Happy Start to Lifelong Learning 🌈",
      "news_category": "Education",
      "news_content": "The infant stage is one of the most important periods in a child’s learning journey. It is a time when young minds are curious, playful, and eager to explore the world around them. At our Infant School, we provide a safe, loving, and stimulating environment where every child feels valued and happy.\n\nLearning at the infant level is fun and engaging. Through songs, storytelling, games, drawing, and hands-on activities, children develop early literacy, numeracy, creativity, and social skills. Play-based learning helps children express themselves, build confidence, and learn how to share and work with others.\n\nOur dedicated teachers understand that every child is unique. They patiently guide learners at their own pace, encouraging curiosity and positive behaviour. We also focus on good values such as respect, kindness, and independence to help children grow into responsible individuals.\n\nParents are our partners in education. By working closely with families, we ensure that each child receives the care, guidance, and encouragement they need to thrive.\n\nA strong foundation begins in infant school. With love, care, and the right learning environment, we give our children a joyful start and prepare them for a bright future. 🌟",
      "date": "Dec 14, 2025",  "news_img":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP228uqnu9mHLnTKzFOnxzk0oTYKmMNFaZfIg3d5pTpdGsx1m6KTF46f6vuHit8uM3K1xE37AaSBfEYK4gmiHc7QpnPj74bLFRUppFETnXivSWXVq8"
 },
    { 
  "news_heading": "Holiday Update - 5th December 2025",
      "news_category": "Education",
      "news_content": "Hello wonderful students and hardworking educators!🎉\nToday, 5th December, is officially a holiday, and we hope it brings you rest, joy, and a little fun\nEven though school activities are on pause, learning doesn’t have to be. Here are a few exciting ways to keep your mind active today:\n✨Try Educational Games – Quick quizzes, typing challenges, puzzle apps or brain teasers can be fun and smart at the same time.\n📚 Read Something Interesting – A short story, an article, or even a chapter of a book can spark new ideas.\n🎨 Be Creative – Draw, write,design or build something using simple materials at home. Creativity builds thinking power.\n👨‍👩‍👦Family Learning Moments – Share ideas, ask questions, help with small tasks or explore something together. Learning grows when shared.\nEnjoy this break, refresh your mind, and let’s return ready to achieve more. \nHave a beautiful holiday! 🌟",
      "date": "Dec 4, 2025",  "news_img":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP228uqnu9mHLnTKzFOnxzk0oTYKmMNFaZfIg3d5pTpdGsx1m6KTF46f6vuHit8uM3K1xE37AaSBfEYK4gmiHc7QpnPj74bLFRUppFETnXivSWXVq8"
 },

   { "news_heading": "The Student Projects Section: Where Creativity Comes Alive!", 
     "news_category": "WEB APP", 
     "news_content": "One of the most exciting parts of our library page is the Student Projects section — a space bursting with ideas, creativity, and talent! This section proudly showcases the amazing work our learners create across different subjects and skill levels.\n\nFrom beautiful posters and digital artworks to smart tech projects and hands-on models, the page highlights just how imaginative and innovative our students can be. Each project tells a story, celebrates effort, and inspires others to think boldly and try new things.\n\nWhether you're a student looking for inspiration, a teacher searching for classroom ideas, or a parent eager to see what learners can achieve, this section never disappoints. It’s fresh, colourful, and constantly growing — proof that learning at our school goes far beyond the classroom.\n\nDive in and explore the creativity! ✨📚🚀.", 
"date": "Nov 15, 2025", 
"news_img": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNHLiJY0SC4dfN3INslyTM-2LeBO-QgIl9Yz4rAlRBqfGHCI3dIJAnTfWIDXqMJ2ybxIQ9ReGnQ4BYH9tMukxvAYRIiIcj2Ob2dRDR6bWp3DrMR_20" 
},
