      "news_category": "Education",
      "news_content":"At Mays Educational Centre (MEC), learning goes beyond books! Our students recently showcased their skills during exciting Food and Nutrition practicals, turning lessons into real-life experiences. \nWith guidance from their teachers, the young chefs prepared delicious dishes while learning teamwork, creativity, and healthy living. These hands-on sessions help build confidence and life skills that last far beyond the classroom./n💫 Mays Educational Centre — where learning comes alive!",
