    { "news_heading": "🥋 Young Students Showcase Impressive Taekwondo Skills!", 
      "news_category": "Education", 
      "news_content": "Our young students recently put on an exciting display of taekwondo skill and discipline! With sharp movements, focused stances, and strong determination, they showed the true spirit of the sport.\n\nThe training and teamwork behind the scenes were clear in every kick and block. Students demonstrated not just physical ability, but also respect, confidence, and dedication — qualities taekwondo is known for.\n\nTeachers and classmates cheered them on as they proved that sports can build strength, character, and unity within our school community.\n\nWe are proud of their efforts and look forward to seeing even more amazing performances in the future. Keep aiming high, champions! 🏅🔥.",
      "date": "Aug 8, 2025", 
      "news_img": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOiPImYq2cTVV3Uo1V45MDGVtUyctqSbB4UZPMIh9neXqRGuWeHA-6qioPLFVVulNOBMKPgMf0pkFDV_avFHTL460qnXkXpCuJ2hliAHd4nJe_LHiw" 
    },
    {
      "news_heading": "🎓 Celebrating Our JHS 3 Graduates!",
      "news_category": "Education",
      "news_content": "Congratulations to our amazing JHS 3 students who successfully completed their studies this year at Mays Educational Centre! 🎉\nYour hard work, dedication, and determination have paid off, and we couldn’t be prouder of how far you’ve come. As you move on to the next stage of your education, remember — once a Mays student, always part of the MEC family.\nKeep shining, keep striving, and continue to make us proud wherever you go! 🌟\n💙 Mays Educational Centre — Building bright futures, one student at a time.",
